{"parse": {"title": "无调性序列", "pageid": 139424, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"cloth-info\"><div class=\"cloth-info--img\" style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"无调性序列\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/20/Cloth-7.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"无调性序列\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"cloth-info--txt\"><div class=\"serif\"><div style=\"font-size:22px; line-height:0.9;\">无调性序列</div><div class=\"grey-small\">Atonal Sequence</div></div><div class=\"serif\" style=\"color:grey\">平等，均分，依次前进，以非凡的排列成就伟大的事业。</div><div class=\"serif\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">司辰的激情 | <span class=\"grey-small\">MOXIE</span></div><hr style=\"margin:5px 0\" /><div style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap;\"><div style=\"width:50%; padding-right:12px\"><span style=\"color:grey\">回合恢复</span><div style=\"float:right\">+10</div></div><div style=\"width:50%; padding-right:12px\"><span style=\"color:grey\">初始激情</span><div style=\"float:right\">+20</div></div></div><div style=\"color:#D4612B; margin-top:6px\">司辰的初始激情提高；使用交感能量获得激情</div><div class=\"serif\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">咒语 | <span class=\"grey-small\">INCANTATION</span></div><hr style=\"margin:5px 0\" /><div><div><img alt=\"Cancost1 glow.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/Cancost1_glow.png/22px-Cancost1_glow.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/Cancost1_glow.png/33px-Cancost1_glow.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/ce/Cancost1_glow.png/44px-Cancost1_glow.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"60\" data-file-height=\"60\" /><span class=\"grey-small\">Cost: 0</span><div>弃置一张交感能量，获得一张交感能量</div></div></div><div><div><img alt=\"Cancost2 glow.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/99/Cancost2_glow.png/22px-Cancost2_glow.png\" decoding=\"